1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:15,150
As expected of Master !

25
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:17,980
I can't believe you managed to hide like this.

26
00:02:41,510 --> 00:02:41,760
master of this move.

27
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:42,910
Is this thing also a Celestial Beast Feed ?

28
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:44,950
I'm unsure who is eating whom...

29
00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:47,310
I can handle a few Celestial Beast Feeds

30
00:02:47,980 --> 00:02:50,070
but this one is terrifying.

31
00:02:50,300 --> 00:02:51,950
I must not disturb it.

32
00:03:04,660 --> 00:03:05,630
This is...

33
00:03:06,140 --> 00:03:07,910
a celestial restriction ?

34
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:13,390
This is bad !

35
00:03:30,980 --> 00:03:33,190
These Celestial Beast Feeds don't have a divine sense,

36
00:03:33,660 --> 00:03:35,630
they can only act on sight.

37
00:03:36,700 --> 00:03:38,390
I should be able to hide.

38
00:03:52,380 --> 00:03:53,630
As expected

39
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:23,710
We made it out of there

40
00:04:23,980 --> 00:04:25,510
thanks to the wandering souls.

41
00:04:55,980 --> 00:04:57,190
Fellow cultivator,

42
00:04:57,460 --> 00:04:59,700
I'm afraid we are the only two people

43
00:04:59,580 --> 00:05:01,590
remaining in the Celestial Beast Temple.

44
00:05:03,060 --> 00:05:05,300
Since this place has already collapsed,

45
00:05:05,140 --> 00:05:07,320
why did fellow cultivator come find me

46
00:05:07,180 --> 00:05:09,470
instead of looking for a way out ?

47
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:12,490
Fellow cultivator doesn't have to worry.

48
00:05:12,290 --> 00:05:14,190
My name is Sun Lei.

49
00:05:14,060 --> 00:05:15,570
You must have seen

50
00:05:15,380 --> 00:05:17,100
what happened just now.

51
00:05:17,780 --> 00:05:19,500
I'm not afraid to tell you

52
00:05:19,380 --> 00:05:21,630
that I'm not really from the Da Lou Sword Sect.

53
00:05:21,540 --> 00:05:22,790
I infiltrated the sect

54
00:05:23,370 --> 00:05:25,130
to kill and steal treasures.

55
00:05:24,940 --> 00:05:28,430
If fellow cultivator takes one more step, I will have to act.

56
00:05:33,580 --> 00:05:36,150
This person is only Early stage Soul Formation

57
00:05:35,980 --> 00:05:38,110
but his divine sense is very powerful.

58
00:05:39,180 --> 00:05:41,470
If I specifically didn't know a technique

59
00:05:41,980 --> 00:05:43,950
to detect divine sense,

60
00:05:44,580 --> 00:05:47,950
I would not have been able to notice him following us.

61
00:05:48,140 --> 00:05:49,470
I know,

62
00:05:49,980 --> 00:05:51,870
he must be hiding his cultivation.

63
00:05:52,500 --> 00:05:53,750
Fellow cultivator,

64
00:05:54,460 --> 00:05:56,450
I won't beat around the bush,

65
00:05:56,300 --> 00:05:58,070
there are 3 treasures in this cave.

66
00:05:59,030 --> 00:06:00,830
The first is a celestial jade

67
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:02,610
the second is celestial metal,

68
00:06:02,460 --> 00:06:04,190
the third is a celestial sword.

69
00:06:05,170 --> 00:06:06,910
How many

70
00:06:06,740 --> 00:06:08,150
did you obtain ?

71
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:11,070
They came back too fast,

72
00:06:11,340 --> 00:06:12,550
so I didn't get any.

73
00:06:14,580 --> 00:06:16,550
It's hard to predict what will happen,

74
00:06:16,380 --> 00:06:18,910
I'd rather be with him to take the treasures.

75
00:06:19,180 --> 00:06:21,350
When facing the Celestial Beast Feeds,

76
00:06:21,660 --> 00:06:23,590
I will still have a chance to kill him.

77
00:06:26,580 --> 00:06:27,670
Fellow cultivator,

78
00:06:27,460 --> 00:06:29,030
the celestial jade has been condensing

79
00:06:28,820 --> 00:06:30,930
celestial spiritual energy for thousands of years

80
00:06:30,780 --> 00:06:32,630
and is considered priceless.

81
00:06:33,420 --> 00:06:34,750
My guess is that

82
00:06:35,300 --> 00:06:36,590
the celestial metal

83
00:06:36,580 --> 00:06:38,430
is a type of defensive artifact.

84
00:06:39,460 --> 00:06:41,360
And the most precious thing

85
00:06:41,210 --> 00:06:42,780
is the celestial sword.

86
00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:47,050
There are many Celestial Beast Feeds.

87
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:49,030
so it will be hard to get the 3 treasures.

88
00:06:49,500 --> 00:06:52,230
Why don't you and I work together ?

89
00:06:52,740 --> 00:06:55,390
Oh ? And why should I help you ?

90
00:06:56,860 --> 00:06:58,880
I only want the celestial sword.

91
00:06:58,780 --> 00:07:00,030
The other two

92
00:07:00,380 --> 00:07:01,590
will belong to you.

93
00:07:01,940 --> 00:07:03,190
How is that ?

94
00:07:03,420 --> 00:07:05,790
I don't want the celestial sword.

95
00:07:06,780 --> 00:07:08,870
And I'm not interested

96
00:07:08,740 --> 00:07:10,790
in the other 2 treasures either.

97
00:07:11,900 --> 00:07:13,830
Fellow cultivator, what do you want ?

98
00:07:14,740 --> 00:07:16,470
If he wasn't hiding his cultivation

99
00:07:16,540 --> 00:07:17,950
I would have already killed him

100
00:07:18,700 --> 00:07:20,110
to prevent future troubles.

101
00:07:20,620 --> 00:07:22,070
Fellow cultivator Sun,

102
00:07:22,340 --> 00:07:25,450
You want me to risk my life to help you get the celestial sword

103
00:07:25,330 --> 00:07:28,390
for just 2 items that might not even be obtainable ?

104
00:07:28,260 --> 00:07:29,760
Do you think I'm 3 years old ?

105
00:07:29,580 --> 00:07:30,910
What do you want?

106
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:33,430
I noticed that when you arrived

107
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:35,550
you guys were able to detect the spacial rifts

108
00:07:36,180 --> 00:07:38,030
before they even appeared…

109
00:07:40,180 --> 00:07:41,470
Full Search Tactic

110
00:07:41,980 --> 00:07:44,210
It's a technique of the Da Lou Sword Sect.

111
00:07:44,620 --> 00:07:45,990
It's not a problem

112
00:07:45,980 --> 00:07:47,270
to gift it to you.

113
00:07:47,290 --> 00:07:49,270
Fellow cultivator is indeed quick on his decisions,

114
00:07:49,060 --> 00:07:51,010
so I won't beat around the bush anymore

115
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:52,910
I want that gourd

116
00:07:52,700 --> 00:07:54,630
in your Third Senior's bag,

117
00:07:54,980 --> 00:07:57,350
then I’ll be willing to take this risk with you.

118
00:07:58,300 --> 00:07:59,790
Fellow cultivator, don't make it hard for me.

119
00:08:00,380 --> 00:08:01,630
This gourd

120
00:08:01,780 --> 00:08:04,910
is the reason why I infiltrated the Da Lou Sword Sect.

121
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:08,430
If fellow cultivator helps me get the celestial sword,

122
00:08:08,630 --> 00:08:10,910
Purification wood

123
00:08:08,620 --> 00:08:10,510
I will give you a piece of purification wood.

124
00:08:11,460 --> 00:08:14,310
Although it isn’t as good as the gourd

125
00:08:15,060 --> 00:08:18,030
it can also absorb celestial spiritual energy.

126
00:08:18,980 --> 00:08:20,790
Fellow cultivator can lead the way.

127
00:08:37,820 --> 00:08:39,730
That black beast feed

128
00:08:39,580 --> 00:08:42,310
must have devoured that skeleton.

129
00:08:42,580 --> 00:08:44,350
It was nourished by the celestial treasures

130
00:08:44,140 --> 00:08:45,770
and it gained its own domain.

131
00:08:46,580 --> 00:08:48,990
The reason why there are so many Celestial Beast Feeds

132
00:08:48,780 --> 00:08:51,030
is that they must all be its offspring.

133
00:08:51,820 --> 00:08:53,070
To get the treasures,

134
00:08:52,860 --> 00:08:54,870
we must reduce their numbers.

135
00:08:55,580 --> 00:08:56,830
Fellow cultivator,

136
00:08:56,740 --> 00:08:59,070
I’ll lure them out with a technique.

137
00:08:59,460 --> 00:09:00,830
Then we

138
00:09:00,660 --> 00:09:02,910
kill as many of them as we can.

139
00:09:03,340 --> 00:09:04,910
Once the black one moves

140
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:07,130
we'll run away immediately.

141
00:09:07,060 --> 00:09:08,790
and meet back where we met.

142
00:09:18,940 --> 00:09:20,190
Thunder Toad !

143
00:09:20,860 --> 00:09:22,070
Let's start.

144
00:09:35,060 --> 00:09:36,790
Nine-colored Rainbow Smoke

145
00:09:36,580 --> 00:09:37,470
Go!

146
00:10:14,780 --> 00:10:15,910
Fellow cultivator,

147
00:10:15,700 --> 00:10:16,630
together

148
00:10:16,980 --> 00:10:19,070
we can beat any amount of beast feeds.

149
00:10:23,940 --> 00:10:25,190
Here it comes.

150
00:10:59,380 --> 00:11:00,630
This is bad,

151
00:11:01,340 --> 00:11:02,830
I'm running out of spiritual energy.

152
00:11:03,140 --> 00:11:04,390
If he acts now,

153
00:11:05,220 --> 00:11:06,470
it's over for me.

154
00:11:11,220 --> 00:11:13,230
Brother Sun was not where we agreed to meet

155
00:11:13,510 --> 00:11:14,940
but it turns out you're injured.

156
00:11:15,780 --> 00:11:17,190
In that case,

157
00:11:16,980 --> 00:11:18,630
please continue to cultivate

158
00:11:18,940 --> 00:11:20,470
while I protect you.

159
00:11:22,020 --> 00:11:23,750
He faced the black beast feed

160
00:11:23,620 --> 00:11:25,470
and was unharmed.

161
00:11:25,980 --> 00:11:27,270
This person's cultivation

162
00:11:27,860 --> 00:11:28,950
is enigmatic.

163
00:11:37,620 --> 00:11:39,430
Fellow cultivator, lets go back.

164
00:11:40,420 --> 00:11:42,230
Today, I will definitely kill that beast feed

165
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:43,990
to avenge my finger.

166
00:11:44,500 --> 00:11:46,430
Bastard, come out !

167
00:12:12,580 --> 00:12:15,910
Sun Lei's Origin Soul
Da Lou Sword Sect

168
00:12:26,730 --> 00:12:27,630
Fellow cultivator,

169
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:28,830
this technique has a time limit,

170
00:12:28,580 --> 00:12:30,110
it will only last 10 breaths.

171
00:12:30,100 --> 00:12:31,790
I will go get the treasures first

172
00:12:31,740 --> 00:12:33,430
and then come to save you.

173
00:12:34,020 --> 00:12:35,230
Fellow cultivator Sun,

174
00:12:35,460 --> 00:12:37,630
you haven't given me the purification wood yet.

175
00:12:37,860 --> 00:12:39,670
Why are you in such a hurry ?

176
00:13:12,820 --> 00:13:14,430
If we fight now,

177
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:16,750
when the Celestial Beast Feeds come back

178
00:13:17,110 --> 00:13:18,470
I may not survive.

179
00:13:39,860 --> 00:13:42,030
The sword is protected by celestial restrictions.

180
00:13:42,550 --> 00:13:44,270
Even with my Master's jade,

181
00:13:44,030 --> 00:13:45,510
I need to take it slow.

182
00:13:46,740 --> 00:13:48,270
A normal cultivator

183
00:13:48,700 --> 00:13:50,790
will die if he attempts to break it.

184
00:14:01,340 --> 00:14:03,470
Although this restriction is exquisite

185
00:14:05,180 --> 00:14:07,030
it's not unbreakable.

186
00:14:09,460 --> 00:14:10,790
This...this...

187
00:14:32,580 --> 00:14:33,990
Master's treasure

188
00:14:33,760 --> 00:14:35,500
can freeze everything for 10 breaths.

189
00:14:35,300 --> 00:14:37,460
Yet it only lasted 8 breaths !?

190
00:14:42,660 --> 00:14:44,430
That bastard !

191
00:15:01,540 --> 00:15:03,030
All of this scheming

192
00:15:04,180 --> 00:15:06,070
was in vain.

193
00:15:06,980 --> 00:15:08,390
Let's...

194
00:15:09,220 --> 00:15:11,030
die together !

195
00:15:13,150 --> 00:15:14,350
Explode !

196
00:15:51,740 --> 00:15:52,630
This is...

197
00:15:53,580 --> 00:15:54,630
spatial rifts ?

198
00:15:58,660 --> 00:15:59,590
Master,

199
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:01,150
this place is collapsing !

200
00:16:13,980 --> 00:16:15,270
It's collapsing ! It's collapsing !

201
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:16,390
Not just the cave

202
00:16:16,380 --> 00:16:19,790
but this whole Celestial Realm fragment is collapsing.

203
00:17:11,220 --> 00:17:18,150
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust
like water without a source.

204
00:17:17,970 --> 00:17:24,310
Like the difference between clouds and mud,
the truth cannot be found in conflict.

205
00:17:24,170 --> 00:17:28,250
Life and death
are like the moment when the rain falls

206
00:17:28,030 --> 00:17:32,180
and like many other unseparable things.

207
00:17:32,290 --> 00:17:38,190
In this lifetime,
to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

208
00:17:39,120 --> 00:17:45,200
Old grudges had to be settled
because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

209
00:17:45,260 --> 00:17:51,050
Use the most vivid love and hate
to ask questions to your fate.

210
00:17:51,260 --> 00:17:55,730
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage
to pierce the heart and the soul

211
00:17:55,740 --> 00:17:59,220
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

212
00:17:59,140 --> 00:18:05,210
Only when you bend down can you understand
the hidden edge of the blade.

213
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:09,410
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

214
00:18:09,260 --> 00:18:13,330
Life and death are just moments away,
there are many other solutions to grudges.

215
00:18:13,260 --> 00:18:19,180
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

216
00:18:19,190 --> 00:18:23,110
One stroke is for killing.
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

217
00:18:23,070 --> 00:18:26,890
One stroke is for caring.
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

218
00:18:26,760 --> 00:18:32,930
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

219
